Herdr Drag Splits

The layout and the drag-tabs and drag-pane mods are derived from the
Herdr app's main layout, tabs mod and pane mod, version 0.1.16:
https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app

Herdr is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).
Changes add tab-to-split dragging, pane-to-tab dragging, a translucent
drop overlay and custom tab-name preservation. The derived JavaScript
files include a modification notice; mod/layout metadata retains the
original cloned_from version.
